{"version_id": 31, "article_id": 4, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Former German spy chief arrested for spying", "title_zh": "德国前情报局长因间谍罪被捕", "topic": "world", "source": "bbc_world", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c58jzyer1kr0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(230, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(268, 46%, 48%)", "label": "WORLD", "seed": "cf9eb2e77a6c"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 120, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "A former German spy chief is in trouble. Police arrested him for spying and treason.", "lead_zh": "德国一名前情报局长出事了。警方以间谍和叛国罪逮捕了他。", "preview": "August Hanning is a former spy chief in Germany. He led the BND from 1998 to 2005. Police arrested him at his home in Nordwalde. They say he", "preview_zh": "奥古斯特·汉宁是德国前情报局长。他在1998年到2005年领导联邦情报局（BND）。警方在他位于诺德瓦尔德的家中逮捕了他。他们说他为外国势力从事间谍活动。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 21, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8df5e71/content/audio/4/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 51.225, "size_bytes": 311040, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 135, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8df5e71/content/data/versions/31.json", "paragraphs": ["August Hanning is a former spy chief in Germany. He led the BND from 1998 to 2005. Police arrested him at his home in Nordwalde. They say he spied for a foreign power.", "Police also arrested Manfred D. He worked for the BND until this year. Police say he gave Hanning about 2,000 secret documents. He got money for the documents.", "Prosecutors say Hanning wrote a report for a foreign spy service. He also talked to another foreign spy service for many years. Police did not say which countries.", "Hanning will go to court on Wednesday. Manfred D will go to court on Tuesday. The BND had a similar problem in 2023. An officer was charged with spying for Russia."], "paragraphs_zh": ["奥古斯特·汉宁是德国前情报局长。他在1998年到2005年领导联邦情报局（BND）。警方在他位于诺德瓦尔德的家中逮捕了他。他们说他为外国势力从事间谍活动。", "警方还逮捕了曼弗雷德·D。他在联邦情报局工作到今年。警方说他把大约2000份机密文件交给了汉宁。他因此获得了金钱。", "检察官说，汉宁为一个外国间谍机构撰写了一份分析报告。他还与另一个外国间谍机构保持了多年联系。警方没有说明涉及哪些国家。", "汉宁将于周三出庭。曼弗雷德·D将于周二出庭。联邦情报局在2023年也遇到过类似问题。一名官员被指控为俄罗斯从事间谍活动。"], "body": "August Hanning is a former spy chief in Germany. He led the BND from 1998 to 2005. Police arrested him at his home in Nordwalde. They say he spied for a foreign power.\n\nPolice also arrested Manfred D. He worked for the BND until this year. Police say he gave Hanning about 2,000 secret documents. He got money for the documents.\n\nProsecutors say Hanning wrote a report for a foreign spy service. He also talked to another foreign spy service for many years. Police did not say which countries.\n\nHanning will go to court on Wednesday. Manfred D will go to court on Tuesday. The BND had a similar problem in 2023. An officer was charged with spying for Russia.", "body_zh": "奥古斯特·汉宁是德国前情报局长。他在1998年到2005年领导联邦情报局（BND）。警方在他位于诺德瓦尔德的家中逮捕了他。他们说他为外国势力从事间谍活动。\n\n警方还逮捕了曼弗雷德·D。他在联邦情报局工作到今年。警方说他把大约2000份机密文件交给了汉宁。他因此获得了金钱。\n\n检察官说，汉宁为一个外国间谍机构撰写了一份分析报告。他还与另一个外国间谍机构保持了多年联系。警方没有说明涉及哪些国家。\n\n汉宁将于周三出庭。曼弗雷德·D将于周二出庭。联邦情报局在2023年也遇到过类似问题。一名官员被指控为俄罗斯从事间谍活动。", "text": "August Hanning is a former spy chief in Germany. He led the BND from 1998 to 2005. Police arrested him at his home in Nordwalde. They say he spied for a foreign power. Police also arrested Manfred D. He worked for the BND until this year. Police say he gave Hanning about 2,000 secret documents. He got money for the documents. Prosecutors say Hanning wrote a report for a foreign spy service. He also talked to another foreign spy service for many years. Police did not say which countries. Hanning will go to court on Wednesday. Manfred D will go to court on Tuesday. The BND had a similar problem in 2023. An officer was charged with spying for Russia.", "vocab": [{"word": "arrest", "pos": "verb", "zh": "逮捕", "note": "常用词，表示警方抓人"}, {"word": "spy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "间谍", "note": "也可作动词，表示从事间谍活动"}, {"word": "chief", "pos": "noun", "zh": "局长；首领", "note": "常用来指机构负责人"}, {"word": "secret", "pos": "adj", "zh": "秘密的", "note": "也可作名词，表示秘密"}, {"word": "document", "pos": "noun", "zh": "文件", "note": "常用词，指书面材料"}, {"word": "foreign", "pos": "adj", "zh": "外国的", "note": "常与 country 或 power 搭配"}, {"word": "court", "pos": "noun", "zh": "法庭", "note": "go to court 表示出庭"}, {"word": "charge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "指控", "note": "常用被动语态，如 be charged with"}], "title_original": "Former German spy chief arrested for espionage and treason", "summary_original": "August Hanning is accused of obtaining classified information for a foreign power.", "body_original": "Former German spy chief arrested for espionage and treason\nBy\nOlivia Ireland\nPublished\n6 hours ago\nFormer German spy chief August Hanning has been arrested on suspicion of espionage, treason and obtaining classified information for a foreign power, the German Federal Prosecutor's Office says.\nHanning headed the Federal Intelligence Service (BND) from 1998 to 2005 and has since been working as a private consultant.\nProsecutors allege that he used classified intelligence to \"draft an analysis\" for one foreign intelligence service and maintained contact with another foreign spying service. Investigators have not disclosed which foreign powers were involved.\nPolice also arrested former BND employee Manfred D, accusing him of passing Hanning about 2,000 classified documents for money.\nManfred D, who was Hanning's bureau chief and remained in the BND until this year, is charged with aiding and abetting attempted treason and treasonous espionage.\nLocal media reported Hanning was arrested at his home in Nordwalde near Münster while Manfred D was arrested in Bavaria. Hanning is due in court on Wednesday and Manfred D will appear on Tuesday.\nProsecutors say Manfred D, who also served as the chief of staff for Hanning's successors between 2012 and 2026, used his role to gain access to highly confidential information which he then passed on to Hanning \"in exchange for remuneration\".\n\"The current findings suggest that, over the years, Manfred D provided Hanning with approximately 2,000 documents, many of which contained classified information to be used exclusively by the Federal Intelligence Service for internal purposes,\" the statement says.\n\"On one occasion, Hanning used classified intelligence ... to draft an analysis for an officer of a foreign intelligence service,\" prosecutors said, noting it was not clear if \"the material reached the intended recipient\".\nHanning is also accused of being \"in close contact with a representative of another foreign intelligence service, to whom he passed on political information, partially based on material provided by Manfred D, for several years\".\nLocal media say Hanning's alleged possession of intelligence documents came to light during a separate case relating to German steakhouse heiress Christina Block.\nHamburg public prosecutor's office accused Block of orchestrating the kidnapping of her two youngest children in 2023 due to a custody dispute. Investigators allege Hanning was involved in an earlier attempted kidnapping of the children, which he denies.\nState criminal police officers reportedly discovered an electronic data storage device containing sensitive information including recent BND documents.\nIt is not the first time the BND has faced similar controversy. A high-ranking German intelligence officer was\ncharged with treason in 2023\nfor allegedly passing state secrets to Russia.\nProsecutors alleged Carsten L shared intelligence about the war in Ukraine and the Wagner mercenary group and received roughly €400,000 ($450,000; £340,000). His trial is ongoing.\nRelated topics\nGermany\nCorruption\nSpying\nMore on this story\nAlmost 60,000 far-right extremists in Germany, intelligence agency says\nPublished\n30 June\nGermany investigates Russia links to weapons cache discovered in woods, reports say\nPublished\n21 August", "fetched_at": "2026-10-06T16:39:02.526512", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "August", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.525, "sm": 100, "em": 525, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Hanning", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.938, "sm": 537, "em": 937, "cs": 7, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.05, "sm": 950, "em": 1050, "cs": 15, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "a", "s": 1.062, "e": 1.137, "sm": 1062, "em": 1137, "cs": 18, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "former", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.487, "sm": 1150, "em": 1487, "cs": 20, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "spy", "s": 1.5, "e": 1.788, "sm": 1500, "em": 1787, "cs": 27, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "chief", "s": 1.8, "e": 2.087, "sm": 1800, "em": 2087, "cs": 31, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "in", "s": 2.1, "e": 2.212, "sm": 2100, "em": 2212, "cs": 37, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Germany", "s": 2.225, "e": 2.763, "sm": 2225, "em": 2762, "cs": 40, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ".", "s": 2.763, "e": 3.638, "sm": 2762, "em": 3637, "cs": 47, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "He", "s": 3.638, "e": 3.788, "sm": 3637, "em": 3787, "cs": 49, "ce": 51, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "led", "s": 3.8, "e": 4.05, "sm": 3800, "em": 4050, "cs": 52, "ce": 55, "si": 1}, {"i": 12, "w": "the", "s": 4.062, "e": 4.15, "sm": 4062, "em": 4150, "cs": 56, "ce": 59, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "BND", "s": 4.162, "e": 4.737, "sm": 4162, "em": 4737, "cs": 60, "ce": 63, "si": 1}, {"i": 14, "w": "from", "s": 4.75, "e": 5.45, "sm": 4750, "em": 5450, "cs": 64, "ce": 68, "si": 1}, {"i": 15, "w": "1998", "s": 5.45, "e": 6.15, "sm": 5450, "em": 6150, "cs": 69, "ce": 73, "si": 1}, {"i": 16, "w": "to", "s": 6.15, "e": 6.5, "sm": 6150, "em": 6500, "cs": 74, "ce": 76, "si": 1}, {"i": 17, "w": "2005", "s": 6.5, "e": 7.2, "sm": 6500, "em": 7200, "cs": 77, "ce": 81, "si": 1}, {"i": 18, "w": ".", "s": 7.2, "e": 8.062, "sm": 7200, "em": 8062, "cs": 81, "ce": 82, "si": 1}, {"i": 19, "w": "Police", "s": 8.0